# This repository is public.  Original game files, and anything taken from
# them (extracted files, memory dumps, disassembly listings, text dumps),
# stay on your machine.  Put them in these folders:
original/
extracted/
work/

# Disk image formats, anywhere in the tree...
*.dsk
*.do
*.po
*.nib
*.woz
*.2mg
*.d13
